{"id":"387103572d3822c3","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-conservative-theory-cannot-prove-liar.md","title":"一致且捕获释放闭合的理论中说谎者独立","display":"cor-conservative-theory-cannot-prove-liar — 一致且捕获释放闭合的理论中说谎者独立","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-conservative-theory-cannot-prove-liar","aliases":["91-cor-conservative-theory-cannot-prove-liar","91-cor-conserv-liar"],"display":"cor-conservative-theory-cannot-prove-liar — 一致且捕获释放闭合的理论中说谎者独立","depends_on":["[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","[[91-df-capture-axiom]]","[[91-df-release-axiom]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-conservative-theory-cannot-prove-liar"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-conservative-theory-cannot-prove-liar</span><span>91-cor-conserv-liar</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-conservative-theory-cannot-prove-liar — 一致且捕获释放闭合的理论中说谎者独立"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cac035693aea2791\" href=\"?note=cac035693aea2791\" title=\"91-df-liar-sentence\">91-df-liar-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7dc6a6fb8ddfca30\" href=\"?note=7dc6a6fb8ddfca30\" title=\"91-df-capture-axiom\">91-df-capture-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"efd61e76586d57ab\" href=\"?note=efd61e76586d57ab\" title=\"91-df-release-axiom\">91-df-release-axiom</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为经典一致理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(S\\vdash\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span>；句子域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cap}_D(S),\\operatorname{Rel}_D(S)\">\\(\\operatorname{Cap}_D(S),\\operatorname{Rel}_D(S)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7dc6a6fb8ddfca30\" href=\"?note=7dc6a6fb8ddfca30\" title=\"91-df-capture-axiom\">91-df-capture-axiom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"efd61e76586d57ab\" href=\"?note=efd61e76586d57ab\" title=\"91-df-release-axiom\">91-df-release-axiom</a> 的无假设定理闭包性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}conservative\\text{-}theory\\text{-}cannot\\text{-}prove\\text{-}liar}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Cap}_D(S)\\land\\operatorname{Rel}_D(S)\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad S\\nvdash\\lambda\\land S\\nvdash\\neg\\lambda.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}conservative\\text{-}theory\\text{-}cannot\\text{-}prove\\text{-}liar}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Cap}_D(S)\\land\\operatorname{Rel}_D(S)\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad S\\nvdash\\lambda\\land S\\nvdash\\neg\\lambda.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash\\lambda\">\\(S\\vdash\\lambda\\)</span>，捕获得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span>，对角式又得其否定，违背一致性。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash\\neg\\lambda\">\\(S\\vdash\\neg\\lambda\\)</span>，经典对角式得相应真理原子，释放得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，仍矛盾。\n保守性没有用于证明，历史文件名不表示该结论由保守性推出。修订后的规则对域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 参数化，因此可直接取完整真理语言；不再误称捕获/释放只能作用于基础语言。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 13.4；Corollary 14.16 后关于 FS 说谎者独立的说明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-liar-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"cac035693aea2791","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-capture-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"7dc6a6fb8ddfca30","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-capture-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-release-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"efd61e76586d57ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-release-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-capture-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"7dc6a6fb8ddfca30","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Cap}_D(S),\\operatorname{Rel}_D(S)$ 为 [[91-df-capture-axiom]]、[[91-df-release-axiom]] 的无假设定理闭包性质。","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-release-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"efd61e76586d57ab","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Cap}_D(S),\\operatorname{Rel}_D(S)$ 为 [[91-df-capture-axiom]]、[[91-df-release-axiom]] 的无假设定理闭包性质。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S\\vdash\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cap}_D(S),\\operatorname{Rel}_D(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}conservative\\text{-}theory\\text{-}cannot\\text{-}prove\\text{-}liar}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Cap}_D(S)\\land\\operatorname{Rel}_D(S)\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad S\\nvdash\\lambda\\land S\\nvdash\\neg\\lambda.","display":true},{"tex":"S\\vdash\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"S\\vdash\\neg\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false}],"bytes":1625,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-194","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-conservative-theory-cannot-prove-liar]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-194","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-conservative-theory-cannot-prove-liar]]"}],"outgoing":["cac035693aea2791","7dc6a6fb8ddfca30","efd61e76586d57ab"]}